VERDICT: approve
{"verdict":"approve","summary":"Docs/tooling-only change: removes the gh PR-promotion shim and its installer and updates AGENTS.md/justfile comments to match the new manual-gate policy. Verified no in-repo references to gh-wrapper/install-hooks.sh/MU_SKIP_PR_CHECK remain, the justfile `pr` recipe indeed runs no checks (so the new comments are accurate), and the AGENTS.md claims about ai-review.sh's code_review panel and /api/ps probing match the script.","findings":[{"file":"scripts/install-hooks.sh","line":1,"severity":"low","issue":"Lifecycle gap: operators who previously ran this installer have a symlink at ~/.local/bin/gh pointing at the now-deleted scripts/gh-wrapper. After pulling this commit that symlink dangles, and since the wrapper exec'd the real gh, every `gh` invocation on those machines fails until the stale symlink is removed by hand. The diff provides no uninstall/migration step or release note for existing installs."}]}
